From: ttabouch12 <ttabouch12@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 08:44:55 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 20/21] arm64: dts: exynos: gtactive2lte: TMU, thermal zone,
 per-unit CPU voltages, test variants

- TMU node and cpu-thermal zone (passive 90 C, critical 110 C)
- OPP voltages from this unit's ECT/ASV dump (1586 MHz 1.00625 V, 1690
  1.06875 V, 1794 1.0875 V stress-tested), <target min max> so both
  clusters can share BUCK1
- safe2/safe3/safe4 variants: DRM/GPU/cpufreq off/on for bring-up

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C7LhHVoCsrpwunEL6xJhiW
