+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
+/*
+ * Samsung Galaxy Tab Active2 LTE (gtactive2lte, SM-T395) device tree source
+ *
+ * Based on exynos7870-j6lte.dts by Kaustabh Chakraborty.
+ * Hardware facts taken from the vendor exynos7870-gtactive2lte_eur_open_04
+ * device tree (hw rev 04).
